\section theory Theory

This section is under preparation. For the time being, the reader is referred to 
the original research papers.
- Comprehensive description of the FC Taylor and Alamel models is presented 
  in \opcite{VanHoutte05}.
- The overview of numerical algorithms implemented in the VEF AlamDMC program is 
  given in \opcite{GawadIJP2015} and book chapter \opcite{GawadBookChapter2016}.
- An example of the VEF exploited in studying hardening phenomena at the crystal
  level has been presented in study \opcite{Eyckens2015}.
- An example of the VEF application in calibration of advanced anisotropic yield criteria 
  is described in \opcite{BanabicBookChapter2016}.

